    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>puzzle game</strong> immerses you in a world where, every night, dreams and nightmares clash in an ancient struggle. As a field agent for the Bureau of Dreams, you must <strong>investigate</strong> a mysterious abandoned factory and uncover whether it is a secret hideout of the Nightmare Committee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If so, you will need to figure out how they manufacture nightmares and reverse their production to bring restful, peaceful nights to the entire world. All in the utmost secrecy, of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observation</strong>, <strong>deduction</strong>, and <strong>hands-on investigation</strong> will be the keys to your adventure.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>puzzle game</strong> immerses you in a world where, every night, dreams and nightmares clash in an ancient struggle. As a field agent for the Bureau of Dreams, you must <strong>investigate</strong> a mysterious abandoned factory and uncover whether it is a secret hideout of the Nightmare Committee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If so, you will need to figure out how they manufacture nightmares and reverse their production to bring restful, peaceful nights to the entire world. All in the utmost secrecy, of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observation</strong>, <strong>deduction</strong>, and <strong>hands-on investigation</strong> will be the keys to your adventure.</p>",
